<title>UK: UK cocoa imports rose sharply in December.</title>
<headline>UK cocoa imports rose sharply in December.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK cocoa imports in tonnes issued by UK Customs - cocoa beans whole or broken, raw or roasted:</p>
<p>			   DEC     NOV   JAN/DEC 1996    JAN/DEC 1995</p>
<p> TOTAL		19,115   5,699     222,915	    163,103</p>
<p> Sierra Leone	  771     226	 2,917		1,326</p>
<p> Ivory Coast	 4,612     nil	39,319	     39,877</p>
